# Build-time config for the deployed Buzz web bundle.
#
# The pairing QR carries the push gateway only when this is set at BUILD time
# (Vite inlines it). It lived solely in a shell invocation until 2026-09-19,
# which meant any rebuild that forgot it shipped a QR with no push address and
# a pairing card that said so. Committed here so the build is reproducible.
#
# Client base URL for the APNs push gateway (port 6359, port-registry.json).
VITE_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL=https://crichton.tailb3d4b8.ts.net:6359/

# Default Files panel URL: stash prod's front door (port 6831, port-registry.json
# block "stash"). Without it the URL lived only in each browser's localStorage,
# which Safari can clear, so the iPad kept losing it. Settings can still override.
VITE_FILES_PANEL_URL=https://crichton.tailb3d4b8.ts.net:6831/
